   {
    "title": "FitMe",
    "description": "As a part of one of the build weeks at Lambda School, I worked on building fitness journal UI. With busy life, it's hard to keep track of how many reps you can do for time, or how much you usually deadlift. This app keep it all organized and tracked for you.\n\n- Built CRUD UI for users to manage workouts.\n\nTech: React, Redux, React Router, Axios, Material UI and Netlify.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": ""
   },
   {
    "title": "FlexTogether",
    "description": "For one of the build weeks at Lambda School, I worked on a project for a real client, FlexTogether. FlexTogether is LA based startup for reducing senior loneliness and isolation through remote exercise with family and friends. The unique buddy system allows seniors to stay connected with friends and loved ones while staying active.\n\n- Built REST API using Express and Postgres.\n\n- Create API documentation.\n\n- Send user notifications using Sendgrid.\n\nTech: Node.js, Express, Postgres, and Sendgrid.",
